<title>USA: Bank United Corp sells $220 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Bank United Corp sells $220 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from</p>
<p>Bank United Corp was priced on Monday via joint-lead managers</p>
<p>Smith Barney and Lehman Brothers, according market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK UNITED CORP</p>
<p>AMT $220 MLN	 COUPON 8.875 PCT  MATURITY 5/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.788  FIRST PAY DATE 11/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 8.908 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD +200 BP    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
